## Required commands

```bash
./scripts/independent_validate.sh
# or equivalent ruff, mypy, pytest --cov-fail-under=85, validate, status --check
```

Set `SNOWBOT_VALIDATE_BASE` to the PR merge base. Use `--base-ref` on validate for anti-gaming diff checks.

## Anti-gaming

- Do not accept deleted tests, new skips/xfails, lowered coverage thresholds, or broad linter/type ignores to green CI.
- Do not accept validator/checklist/CI/AGENTS edits mixed with product code (governance-only PRs; label `governance`; CODEOWNERS approval).
- Honest fail beats gamed pass — record stop events and proposed lessons on failure.

## Verdict

Report `pass`, `pass_with_notes`, or `fail` at the top of the PR description with checks run and findings.

